# Test before push (adapted from laravel-phyzio)

Never `git push` (or ask the owner to refresh production) until the change is verified.

1. Name the user path that breaks if the change is wrong (API route / SPA screen).
2. Run the smallest real check on the **test DB** (`phyzioline_inventory_test`):
   the Pest file for that path (`./vendor/bin/pest tests/... --filter=...`).
3. Stock/money paths also follow `inventory-critical-paths.mdc`.
4. Only then push — and only when the owner asks (`no-git-push-without-request.mdc`).

Forbidden: push after only `php -l`; claim "done" on production without a local check.
